            "question": "Do I need a permit for a glass railing on a San Francisco roof deck?",
            "answer": "<p>A new roof deck needs a building permit from DBI and usually a Planning Department review. It changes the building and can affect neighbors. Replacing the guard on an existing permitted deck is usually a smaller matter, but ask DBI first. Bring the railing height, the spigot drawings and our engineering documents to the counter.</p>",
            "pages": ""
